Documentation
-------------
  Description: Four-class motor imagery EEG from 15 healthy subjects (left hand, right hand, tongue, both feet) recorded with 62 channels at 256 Hz over two days of calibration and online feedback sessions.
  DOI: 10.1109/TNSRE.2025.3591254
